[{"id":"part-bst","title":"用链接动态保持顺序","section":"bst","role":"section","body":"","goal":"从数组移动的代价引入树形表示","activity":"小节转折","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"bst-node-links","title":"二叉树的结点和链接怎样存储？","section":"bst","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">树上的父子关系需要有可执行的数据表示：每个结点保存关键字，以及指向左右孩子的链接。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>具体树：根指针与孩子关系</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"根指针root指向30；不存在的孩子用空链接NULL表示。\"><title>根指针root指向30；不存在的孩子用空链接NULL表示。</title><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"478\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">30</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">44</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">16</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">27</text><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">36</text><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">55</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根指针root指向30；不存在的孩子用空链接NULL表示。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>最小必要的 C11 结构</h3><pre class=\"d17-code\"><code>typedef struct Node {\n    int key;\n    struct Node *left, *right;\n} Node;\nNode *root;  /* 树的入口 */</code></pre><p class=\"d17-note\">此处只说明字段与结构的对应。实际AVL实现还会另存高度，不改变树的数学定义。</p></div></div></div>","goal":"理解根、结点字段、左右链接和NULL的结构职责","activity":"树形—字段对应","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"bst-order","title":"什么是二叉搜索树（Binary Search Tree，BST）？","section":"bst","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">对任一结点：<b>整个左子树</b>所有关键字都小于它，<b>整个右子树</b>都大于它；左右子树递归满足同一条件。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>满足顺序性质的主例</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"根30左侧是16、20、27；右侧是36、44、55。\"><title>根30左侧是16、20、27；右侧是36、44、55。</title><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"478\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">30</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">44</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">16</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">27</text><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">36</text><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">55</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30左侧是16、20、27；右侧是36、44、55。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>反例：只比较直接孩子并不够</h3><div class=\"d17-question\">若把左子树中的27改为35，它还合法位于根30左侧吗？</div><p>虽然35大于直接父结点20，但<b>35 &gt; 30</b>，违反根30对整棵左子树的要求。</p><p class=\"d17-note\">教材亦称二叉排序树；本讲默认关键字互异。</p></div></div></div>","goal":"建立整棵子树而不只是直接孩子的递归顺序不变量","activity":"具体案例、定义和反例","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"bst-search","title":"查找27：怎样沿着一条路径排除子树？","section":"bst","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>T0：突出当前查找路径</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"依次比较30、20、27；其他支路不需逐一探查。\"><title>依次比较30、20、27；其他支路不需逐一探查。</title><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#17679d\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#17679d\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"478\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">30</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">44</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">16</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">27</text><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">36</text><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">55</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">依次比较30、20、27；其他支路不需逐一探查。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>比较、排除、向下移动</h3><div class=\"d17-steps\"><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>27 &lt; 30</b>排除30及其右子树，进入左子树</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>27 &gt; 20</b>排除20及其左子树，进入右子树</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>27 = 27</b>命中当前结点</div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">每次排除的是满足BST顺序约束的整棵子树。</p></div></div></div>","goal":"在完整树上解释查找方向和排除依据","activity":"追踪访问路径并说明","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"bst-insert","title":"空孩子链接为什么可以成为新结点位置？","section":"bst","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">从原树T0查找25：30左→20右→27左，最后遇到空链接。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>T0：插入前</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"查找失败位置是27的左空孩子。\"><title>查找失败位置是27的左空孩子。</title><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#17679d\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#17679d\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"478\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">30</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">44</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">16</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">27</text><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">36</text><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">55</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">查找失败位置是27的左空孩子。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>T1：插入后</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"25成为新叶子，原有其他结点不需要移动。\"><title>25成为新叶子，原有其他结点不需要移动。</title><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#17679d\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#17679d\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"478\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"245\" x2=\"163\" y2=\"330\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">30</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">44</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">16</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">27</text><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">36</text><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">55</text><circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"330\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#ffe2bb\" stroke=\"#bd7a35\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"163\" y=\"338\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">25成为新叶子，原有其他结点不需要移动。</p></div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">新位置需要同时满足沿途所有祖先的范围约束；下一页核验。</p></div>","goal":"将空孩子位置转化为合法插入链接","activity":"对照插入前后树形","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"bst-check","title":"插入25后，为什么整棵树仍满足顺序性质？","section":"bst","role":"exercise","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"course-workspace d17-workspace\" data-course-component=\"task-workspace\"><div class=\"course-input\" data-task-input><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>完整T1：保留原始推理输入</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"橙色25为新结点，蓝色标记搜索路径。\"><title>橙色25为新结点，蓝色标记搜索路径。</title><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#17679d\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#17679d\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"478\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"245\" x2=\"163\" y2=\"330\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">30</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">44</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">16</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">27</text><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">36</text><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">55</text><circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"330\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#ffe2bb\" stroke=\"#bd7a35\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"163\" y=\"338\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">橙色25为新结点，蓝色标记搜索路径。</p></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><div class=\"course-prompt\" data-task-prompt><div class=\"d17-question\">分别判断25与祖先30、20、27的大小关系。仅检查父结点够吗？</div></div><details class=\"course-answer\" data-task-answer><summary>核对答案与理由</summary><div class=\"course-solution\"><p><b>25 &lt; 30</b>：在根左子树；<b>25 &gt; 20</b>：在20右子树；<b>25 &lt; 27</b>：在27左子树。</p><p>三项祖先约束同时成立，其他子树的链接未变，因此整体保持BST顺序性质。</p></div></details></div></div></div>","goal":"用完整树形检查插入后的全部祖先约束","activity":"独立解释并核对","withheld_results":["25 < 30"]},{"id":"bst-transfer","title":"换一棵新树，30该插在什么位置？","section":"bst","role":"ex