x=\"215\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">35</text><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">50</text><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">75</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根40，左25(10,35)，右60(50,75)。</p></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><div class=\"course-prompt\" data-task-prompt><div class=\"d17-question\">插入30并画出整棵树。它为什么同时满足祖先的范围？</div></div><details class=\"course-answer\" data-task-answer><summary>核对答案与理由</summary><div class=\"course-solution\"><p>比较：30&lt;40，30&gt;25，30&lt;35；因此把30接在<b>35的左空链接</b>。</p><svg class=\"d17-tree\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插入30后的完整新树\"><title>插入30后的完整新树</title><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#17679d\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#17679d\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"478\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"245\" x2=\"163\" y2=\"330\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" 