><text x=\"345\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">36</text><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">55</text><circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"330\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#ffe2bb\" stroke=\"#bd7a35\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"163\" y=\"338\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">如果直接清空父链接，25所在子树也会失去入口。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>从结构变化理解三种情况</h3><div class=\"d17-steps\"><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>叶子结点</b>删除父链接对应的位置即可</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>只有一个孩子</b>让父结点接向唯一孩子</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>两个孩子</b>找保持顺序的替代结点，再正确重接</div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">根结点删除时也可能需要更新根指针，具体语义依实现方式而定。</p></div></div></div>","goal":"通过可达性和父子连接理解BST删除的结构分类","activity":"结构案例再归纳","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"bst-delete-two","title":"从T1删除根30，前驱27的孩子怎么办？","section":"bst","role":"exercise","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"course-workspace d17-workspace\" data-course-component=\"task-workspace\"><div class=\"course-input\" data-task-input><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>完整输入：插入25后的T1</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"从左子树找中序前驱；注意原前驱27有左孩子25。\"><title>从左子树找中序前驱；注意原前驱27有左孩子25。</title><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"478\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"245\" x2=\"163\" y2=\"330\" stroke=\"#7792ac\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d9edf9\" stroke=\"#1b6798\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">30</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"132\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">44</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">16</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#ffe2bb\" stroke=\"#bd7a35\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">27</text><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">36</text><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"245\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7494ac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">55</text><circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"330\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#ffe2bb\" stroke=\"#bd7a35\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"163\" y=\"338\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#173d5e\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">从左子树找中序前驱；注意原前驱27有左孩子25。</p></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><